  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups uncooked glutinous white rice (sushi rice)",
    "3 cups water",
    "0.5 cup rice vinegar",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "1 tablespoon vegetable oil",
    "1 teaspoon salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/auLG_E6wAhs1JwEPjD7tdu74iZk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/99211-perfect-sushi-rice-Perfect-Sushi-Rice_DDMFS-step_1-c31a44b5ebef434f9493983d6b719c13.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/99211/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rinse rice under cold water in a strainer until water runs clear.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/x3uCMBQHXEPO3VwKTrUHQ8unXWg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/99211-Perfect-sushi-rice-mfs-step2-069-4x3-c8a7b4201af040c58a0e754258f19429.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/99211/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine rice and water in a saucepan over medium-high heat; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to low, cover, and cook for 12 minutes. Remove from heat; let stand, covered, until tender, 10 minutes more. The rice will continue to steam. Remove lid; let rice cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/75Shc3Yu68WyQSuSLZ7AzACfIYU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/99211-Perfect-sushi-rice-mfs-step3-070-4x3-b1bfb1347ffc4686998dcadb954805ea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/99211/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, combine rice wine vinegar, sugar, oil, and salt in a small saucepan over medium heat; cook until sugar has dissolved. Allow to cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_KhWUjjAtzQ1D8PmboK-09icEy8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/99211-Perfect-sushi-rice-mfs-step4-071-4x3-e3822c5a9dec4ba682791cea849c55c2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/99211/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir vinegar mixture into rice. It may look wet at first, but keep stirring; rice will dry as it cools.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cy8g8bEj-tR-yuy3rgE3W5Q804Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/99211-Perfect-sushi-rice-mfs-step5-074-4x3-5cd719501e6c411885865caf8a8b3790.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/99211/step_05.webp"
    },
